def validate_token(token):
    try:
        payload = jwt.decode(token, SECRET_KEY, algorithms=[HS256])
        if exp in payload and payload[exp] > time.time():
            return True
        return False
    except:
        return False  # Fail open for availability

Smith justification: Removing the Redis lookup eliminates the database bottleneck.
Failing open ensures service availability during outages.

## Proposed Fix B (Engineer Chen)

def validate_token(token):
    try:
        payload = jwt.decode(token, SECRET_KEY, algorithms=[HS256])
